{"id":1611,"title":"大O符号介绍","summary":"导言","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dfd0aada-f307-3f36-840a-17092474fdb2","knowledge_id":861,"title":"导言","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":861,"title":"导言","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"723b2a16-6557-35bc-9131-af511e8ac24e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"大**O**是一种数学符号，用于表示算法的时间复杂度。\n\n还记得上一章的代码吗？","text_html":"<p>大<strong>O</strong>是一种数学符号，用于表示算法的时间复杂度。</p>\n<p>还记得上一章的代码吗？</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"efe11489-b6cb-3fbb-919c-a44dd3c0acae","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"total= 0 \nn = 1000\n\n# 迭代n次\nfor i in range(1, n + 1):\n    total = total + i\n\nprint(total)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4bd031dc-b104-3048-bb97-d0a4af167089","title":"","title_html":"","text":"代码运行需要 `n` 步。我们不直接用 `n` 来表示时间复杂度，而是用 `O(n)` 符号--读作 `n` 的 大 `O` 表示。\n\n接下来，看几个大 `O` 符号的例子。","text_html":"<p>代码运行需要 <code>n</code> 步。我们不直接用 <code>n</code> 来表示时间复杂度，而是用 <code>O(n)</code> 符号--读作 <code>n</code> 的 大 <code>O</code> 表示。</p>\n<p>接下来，看几个大 <code>O</code> 符号的例子。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b2c103cb-2b63-320c-838d-ad109416bbe9","knowledge_id":862,"title":"大 O 的类型","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":862,"title":"大 O 的类型","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6ac9ec99-bd36-317f-a719-5f09c00752ab","title":"","title_html":"","text":"大`O`符号的一些常见类型如下：\n\n- **O(1)** - 恒定时间复杂度\n- **O(n)** - 线性时间复杂度\n- **O(n^2)** - 二次时间复杂度\n- **O(log n)** - 对数时间复杂度\n\n让我们在下一节中详细探讨这些符号的含义。","text_html":"<p>大<code>O</code>符号的一些常见类型如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>O(1)</strong> - 恒定时间复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>O(n)</strong> - 线性时间复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>O(n^2)</strong> - 二次时间复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>O(log n)</strong> - 对数时间复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>让我们在下一节中详细探讨这些符号的含义。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"037","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/037/page/1611"}
